# CryptoBatz Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit reports completed by Softstack for CryptoBatz.

CryptoBatz is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a historical NFT smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: CryptoBatz  
Audit type: NFT smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

