[02_Smart_Contract_Audit_CryptoBatz_MutantBatz_PUBLIC.pdf](./02_Smart_Contract_Audit_CryptoBatz_MutantBatz_PUBLIC.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed NFT smart contract security work.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s NFT smart contract audit work, including public audit reports for CryptoBatz and MutantBatz.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
